  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A hungry child cannot study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Venezuela, 35% of children under two years of age have chronic malnutrition, characterized by growth retardation, according to the Venezuelan Food Security Observatory. The first years of life are key to the development of children. Malnutrition is a serious problem that we must avoid, to achieve the healthy growth of our children and that they can study. A hungry child cannot study! We need to feed our children and young people, so that they can be the positive leaders that Venezuela needs.</narrative>
  </description>
